    {
      "id": "QQXX3DZG74F2QSVC6NA7RZPX",
      "slug": "the-grimoire",
      "name": "The Grimoire",
      "description": "A Grimoire was never merely just a book. It was a relic. A covenant. Written in ink that did not wash clean.\n\nThese nails were made in the same spirit. I wanted something that would stop you mid-scroll. Something Iconic. Something that the moment you saw it, you just knew.\n\nThese nails use a translucent base pale as candlelight through cathedral glass, marked by two lines of deep crimson that rise like a gothic arch and meet at the tip like a blade laid upon an altar. At the crown of each nail, a 3D sculpted cross in gunmetal and chrome. Hand-placed. Intentional. Unmistakably ours.\n\nBut underneath of all of that, this set was made as a quiet signal. For the ones who have always lived a little sideways from the world. The alt girls. The dark romantics. The ones who paint their nails like armor. This is me saying I see you. I'm here too. This was made for you.\n\nBecause it was.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
