      "id": "3HM26BEEVXD7SWVXO5V2OL2Q",
      "slug": "noir-et-blanc-the-ribbon-collection",
      "name": "Noir et Blanc — The Ribbon Collection",
      "description": "Noir et blanc. Black and white — the oldest argument there is, and the most beautiful. This set doesn't choose a side; it wears both like a ribbon tied at the throat. A bright porcelain base crossed with inkstroke stripes, finished in liquid chrome and crowned with a single sculpted bow. Demure and dangerous in the same breath — the kind of soft that has teeth. The first of the Ribbon Collection, for those who like their elegance with something tied round its neck.\n\nTied in contrast. Worn like a confession.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
