      "id": "ZFUZUCFQZO2E2H7XSEFAGJTO",
      "slug": "la-fraise-jardin-collection",
      "name": "La Fraise — Jardin Collection",
      "description": "La fraise. The strawberry — sweetest thing in the garden, and the first to be devoured. This is the opening bloom of the Jardin Collection, where everything pretty hides a little rot beneath it. A sculpted strawberry sits ripe at the tip, dotted in white seed and fed by a single green leaf — fruit rendered like a still life left one day too long. Sweet, saturated, faintly sinful. For the ones who reach for the forbidden one on purpose.\n\nGrown in the garden. Worn without apology.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
