      "slug": "leviathan-x-benthic",
      "name": "Leviathan x Benthic",
      "description": "Leviathan. The thing the old maps warned you about, drawn in the margins where the water goes black. This set descends — deep green bleeding into abyssal black, textured like the hide of something vast and patient in the cold. A single gem catches the light like an eye opening in the dark. From the Benthic depths, where pressure makes monsters of us all. For those who were never afraid of what's down there. They were curious.\n\nRisen from the deep. Worn like a warning.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
