      "slug": "the-specter",
      "name": "The Specter",
      "description": "The Specter. Not every haunting wears chains. Some are quiet — a presence at the edge of the room, gone when you turn to look. This set is restraint made beautiful: clean matte white, no charm, no noise, only the cold elegance of something not quite of this world. Minimal. Ghostly. Unforgettable for what it withholds. For those who don't need to be loud to be felt.\n\nSeen for a moment. Remembered far longer.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
