      "slug": "the-armory",
      "name": "The Armory",
      "description": "The Armory. Some days you don't dress — you suit up. This set is full chrome, poured like liquid metal and set hard, a mirror finish that throws the light back at anyone who looks too long. Armor for the hand: cold, gleaming, impenetrable. For the days you decide nothing's getting through. You always said you paint your nails like armor — so we made them exactly that.\n\nForged, not worn. Armor for the hand.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
