      "id": "6ANCO2AFLJZDVTXT2D2BJM6H",
      "slug": "the-fool-s-decree",
      "name": "The Fool's Decree",
      "description": "The Fool's Decree. The jester was the only one in the court who could tell the king the truth — and live. This set is that license made visible: a harlequin diamond pattern in dramatic contrast, hung with tiny bells that announce you before you speak. Playful and merciless in equal measure. For the ones who laugh at what they're supposed to fear.\n\nThe fool speaks last. And laughing.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
