      "id": "4L5TSAQPHAAC5W2OZEG6TRDY",
      "slug": "both-altars",
      "name": "Both Altars",
      "description": "Both Altars. Some hearts were never built to kneel at just one. This set is devotion in two directions at once — a deep matte base scattered with a cascade of 3D hearts in rose, violet, and blue, the colors of those who love without choosing a side. Two truths held in the same hand, and no apology owed for either. Inverted, doubled, refusing the line someone else drew. For the ones who go both ways and were told it made them less — it never did. It made you whole.\n\nWorn in both lights. Devoted twice over.\n\nChoose your nail shape:\n\nStiletto - sharp and Unapologetic.\n\nCoffin - Beautiful in the finite.\n\nAlmond - Soft-spoken with darkness behind the eyes\n\nSquare - Deliberate and grounded\n\nSquoval - For those who never quite fit in one category.\n\nStandard sizing for immediate wear. Custom fitted if you want them made exactly for your hand - because something this intentional deserves to fit like it was cast from you directly.\n\nThe Grimoire Set\nCast in Darkness. Worn with intention.",
